sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Manager as ADMIN ou MANAGER
    participant UI as AssignmentsPage
    participant API as ResourceAssignmentsController
    participant Service as ResourceAssignmentsService
    participant Prisma as PrismaService
    participant Audit as AuditLogsService
    participant Notif as NotificationsService

    Manager->>UI: Selectionne ressource disponible et utilisateur actif
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/resource-assignments
    API->>Service: assignResource(dto, currentUser)
    Service->>Prisma: Transaction create assignment ACTIVE
    Service->>Prisma: Transaction update Resource ASSIGNED
    Prisma-->>Service: Assignment creee
    Service->>Audit: RESOURCE_ASSIGNED
    Service->>Notif: RESOURCE_ASSIGNED
    Service-->>API: ResourceAssignmentResponse
    API-->>UI: 201 Created

    Manager->>UI: Retourne la ressource
    UI->>API: PATCH /api/v1/resource-assignments/:id/return
    API->>Service: returnResource(id, dto, currentUser)
    Service->>Prisma: Transaction update assignment RETURNED
    Service->>Prisma: Transaction update Resource AVAILABLE
    Service->>Audit: RESOURCE_RETURNED
    Service->>Notif: RESOURCE_RETURNED
    Service-->>API: ResourceAssignmentResponse
    API-->>UI: 200 OK
